 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5517+) **Reorganized advisors**: **merged** the **espionage** screen into the **Foreign Advisor**, the **Economic Advisor's Finance Tab** into the **Domestic Advisor**, the **Economic Advisor's Environment Tab** into the **Info Screen**, the **Religion** Advisor and **Corporation** Advisor (so it is always visible and easier to access) into the new **Policy Advisor**; so they are now **tabs of these instead** (deleted the old now obsolete lone advisor .py files); **swap advisors**: **Victory screen** to F9 and **Info Screen** to F8 so the Info Screen is easier to split to F7 and F8 later on and so layout is **more logically organized** from internal to external advisors; **split advisors**: the **Foreign Advisor** is now split into **Foreign Trade Advisor (F4)** (TREATIES, BONUSES, TECHS, CITIES), and **Foreign Diplomacy Advisor (F3)** (RELATIONS, GLANCE, INFO, ESPIONAGE) as it **was crowded** to reduce the need for **tab navigation** and for **clearer thematic differentiation**, using a shell (i.e. almost empty file for **linking only**) [CvForeignDiplomacyAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvForeignDiplomacyAdvisor.py) file for the 2nd advisor.
